        "subject": "LU-10026 tests: sanity-compr/1000d failure for ARM client",
        "message": "LU-10026 tests: sanity-compr/1000d failure for ARM client\n\naarch64 has 64K page size and compression chunk size could be adjusted\nupward if it's original setting value is equal to page size, so\nthe test should be refined to get the actual chunk size be set.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-7536\nSigned-off-by: Bobi Jam <bobijam@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ide2f91e255ba886f9c1e18d1e1fe89c589f3bca1\n"
